  <data name="ShellIntegrationInstallDesc.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>初用此测试版，请自第一步依次而行；一步既毕，乃行下一步。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateInstallStepTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>一、置署名凭证</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateInstallStepDesc.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>务依下列次序而行，毋从导引之默认选项。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep1Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>1. 点击右侧之 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep1Action.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>启凭证安置导引。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep2Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>2. Windows 弹出凭证窗口后，点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep2Action.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>安装证书...</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep2Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep3Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>3. 于“证书导入向导”之“存储位置”页，选择 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep3Location.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>本地计算机</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep3Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>，然后点击下一步。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep4Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>4. 若 Windows 询问是否允许更改，点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep4Action.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>是</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep4Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>5. 选择 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5StoreMode.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>将所有的证书都放入下列存储</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Middle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>，再点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Browse.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>浏览...</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep5Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>6. 于列中选择 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Store.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>受信任人</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Middle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>，点击确定，然后点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Next.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>下一步</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep6Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep7Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>7. 确认“证书存储”显示为 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep7Store.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>受信任人</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep7Middle.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>，点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep7Finish.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>完成</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep7Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>；见导入成功后，闭其窗。</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep8Prefix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>8. 返 ClipPort，点击 </value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep8Refresh.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>刷新状态</value></data>
  <data name="CertificateGuideStep8Suffix.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>；俟页面称凭证已置于本地计算机，乃续置组件。</value></data>
  <data name="InstallCertificateButton.Content" xml:space="preserve"><value>启凭证安置导引</value></data>
